# AstroVed.AI Chatbot & Agent Dashboard

AI-powered AstroVed chatbot with Human Agent Dashboard.

---

# Requirements

- Python 3.10 or above
- Git
- Internet connection
- Groq API Key
- AstroVed JWT Token

---

# 1. Clone Repository

```bash
git clone <YOUR_GITHUB_REPO_URL>
cd AI_Chat_Bot
```

Or extract the ZIP file if provided.

---

# 2. Create Virtual Environment

### Windows

```bash
python -m venv vbot
```

Activate

```bash
vbot\Scripts\activate
```

---

### macOS / Linux

```bash
python3 -m venv vbot
```

Activate

```bash
source vbot/bin/activate
```

You should now see

```text
(vbot)
```

---

# 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

# 4. Configure Environment Variables

Create a file named

```text
.env
```

inside the project root.

Example:

```env
GROQ_API_KEY=YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY

ASTROVED_JWT_TOKEN=YOUR_ASTROVED_TOKEN

GITHUB_TOKEN=YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN

GITHUB_REPO=YOUR_USERNAME/AI_Chat_Bot
```

---

# 5. Run Project

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

When everything loads correctly, you should see

```text
Loaded 690 page chunks from knowledge base

Application startup complete.

Uvicorn running on

http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

