# Project Flow

```
User

↓

/app

↓

/chat API

↓

Knowledge Base Search

↓

Groq LLM

↓

Bot Response

↓

CRM Keywords?

↓

No
│
└── Continue Chat

Yes

↓

Agent Queue

↓

/agent/dashboard

↓

Agent Reply

↓

User Receives Reply
```

