# Common Commands

Activate Environment

Windows

```bash
vbot\Scripts\activate
```

macOS/Linux

```bash
source vbot/bin/activate
```

Run

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

Deactivate

```bash
deactivate
```

---

# Common Errors

## Python not found

Use

```bash
python3
```

instead of

```bash
python
```

---

## Uvicorn not found

```bash
pip install uvicorn
```

---

## Missing package

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## Port already in use

Run

```bash
lsof -i :8000
```

Kill process

```bash
kill -9 <PID>
```

or simply use another port

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8001
```

---

## API Key Error

Check

```
.env
```

contains

```
GROQ_API_KEY
```

---

## Chatbot says

```
Server is waking up...
```

This usually means the frontend is pointing to the wrong API URL.

Verify that:

```javascript
var API = window.location.origin;
```

is present in

```
index.html
```

and

```
widget_content.js
```

Then hard refresh the browser.

---

# Render Deployment

Build Command

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Start Command

```bash
uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT
```

Environment Variables

```
GROQ_API_KEY

ASTROVED_JWT_TOKEN

GITHUB_TOKEN

GITHUB_REPO
```

